1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,860
It's time for an update on the local economy.

2
00:00:03,485 --> 00:00:10,200
Thanks to the efforts of Mayor Crawford, several companies have opened branches in Richmond during the past year.

3
00:00:11,140 --> 00:00:14,970
That's been great for the economy as unemployment is at a record low.

4
00:00:15,420 --> 00:00:22,720
However, there's a housing shortage now, so the average price of a house has risen by more than twenty percent this year.

5
00:00:23,405 --> 00:00:30,660
This morning, Carter Construction announced it's building an apartment complex on the eastern side of the Mohawk River.

6
00:00:31,440 --> 00:00:33,720
It will be adjacent to the Danforth Bridge.

7
00:00:34,575 --> 00:00:45,340
Construction won't be complete until eighteen months from now, but when it's done, more than 600 family-sized units will be available for rent or purchase.
